 entered upon him; and he recognized them, but he was to them unknown.","j":13,"h":25,"s":12,"a":58,"sd":null},{"k":"12:59","t":"And when he had furnished them with their supplies, he said, \"Bring me a brother of yours from your father. Do you not see that I give full measure and that I am the best of accommodators?","j":13,"h":25,"s":12,"a":59,"sd":null},{"k":"12:60","t":"But if you do not bring him to me, no measure will there be [hereafter] for you from me, nor will you approach me.\"","j":13,"h":25,"s":12,"a":60,"sd":null},{"k":"12:61","t":"They said, \"We will attempt to dissuade his father from [keeping] him, and indeed, we will do [it].\"","j":13,"h":25,"s":12,"a":61,"sd":null},{"k":"12:62","t":"And [Joseph] said to his servants, \"Put their merchandise into their saddlebags so they might recognize it when they have gone back to their people that perhaps they will [again] return.\"","j":13,"h":25,"s":12,"a":62,"sd":null},{"k":"12:63","t":"So when they returned to their father, they said, \"O our father, [further] measure has been denied to us, so send with us our brother [that] we will be given measure. And indeed, we will be his guardians.\"","j":13,"h":25,"s":12,"a":63,"sd":null}],"juz":13,"hizb":25,"surahs":[12],"sajdah":false}